<title>MALTA: Malta treasury issues Lm3.9 mln 28-day bills.</title>
<headline>Malta treasury issues Lm3.9 mln 28-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malta treasury on Friday issued Lm3.9 million ($10.5 million) 28-day bills maturing on February 7.</p>
<p>The bills have a yield rate of 4.9987 percent per annum, unchanged from the previous issue of December 27.</p>
<p>The yield rate on the 182-day bills is 5.2882 percent per annum, down slightly from 5.2884 in the issue of December 13. The 182-day bills mature on July 11.</p>
<p>($1 = 0.36c)</p>
